# L §8.4 What isn't defined is refused: "an order comparison of two records": LOAD-UNIT at load.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

input a: (x int, y int)
input b: (x int, y int)
def c: bool = a < b at reader

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  a = (x: 1, y: 2)
  b = (x: 1, y: 3)

ask q: c law 2026-06-30
=== expect
refused: LOAD-UNIT ...
